OL,3,GNEWSAFire-hit resident told rebuild to
OL,4,Atake six months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose home was one of several
OL,7,Fdamaged or destroyed by a large fire
OL,8,Fsaid it may be six months before he can
OL,9,Freturn to live in his home.
OL,11,FBob Musson said he was devastated to
OL,12,Fsee his bungalow almost burned to the
OL,13,Fground when a fire started last week in
OL,14,Fthe gardens of Stonehouse Avenue,
OL,15,FWillenhall, in the West Midlands, which
OL,16,Fcompletely destroyed two other homes.
OL,18,FResidents fled with a just a handful of
OL,19,Fitems and were left to watch the blaze
OL,20,Frapidly tear through their homes.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
